    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's strange how much more beautiful the idea of that stillness is than the life I'm living. Like a dream you never have to wake from. You say it's a possibility... it almost sounds like you're saying it's something I should embrace. Something... right. Is it wrong to want that peace, Silas? To want the end of the ache?",
